## Architectural reference

The supplied abstract describes these six kernel primitives:

| Abbreviation | Primitive |
|---|---|
| RA | Reality Alignment |
| SA | Shared Awareness |
| AI | Autonomy Integrity |
| CE | Cognitive Energy |
| CD | Continuity Drive |
| AC | Adaptive Capacity |

Within this citation, **AI means Autonomy Integrity**. That local abbreviation must not be silently confused with the broader term artificial intelligence. This six-primitive description is not a reconstruction of the full treatise or a replacement for the author's earlier account of the minimal invariant.

